rrival and the 181-second dwell, so nothing rests on the platform events. Your rider-presence figures (roughly 877 m from the pin) are not used against you: POL-NS-06 decides the fee whether or not the rider was present, and chargeability turns on the driver's arrival and dwell, not your location. POL-NS-04 cannot exonerate you because you sent no locating or coordinating message in the waiting window - the only chat message is the driver's own notice ('im at the pickup point', 20:37:17, read 20:37:47) - and the driver's account is corroborated by the telemetry rather than merely asserted. Driver, your payout is fixed by POL-NS-07 at SGD 3.60, and the anti-farming check does not trip (driver_profile.no_show_terminations_30d 0, below the 4 threshold, against 62 completed trips in 30 days), so compensation is paid rather than withheld. Every artifact carrying a deciding fact is COMPLETE at weight_multiplier 1.0, so no impairment discount applies and confidence is 0.90, above the 0.70 floor; no POL-NS-09 trigger (a) to (e) is present. The monetary effect of SGD 3.60 is below the SGD 8.00 execution threshold, so the ruling executes automatically. No clause produces a referral on these facts: the arrival marker was genuine, so no false-arrival record under POL-NS-05(ii) arises, and the reason code selected was correct."
